Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.41,0:00:10.25,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.25,0:00:12.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.22,0:02:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, this just doesn't suit my style
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,to just sit and wait like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We pick our spot, then wait patiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the secret behind fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did you ever consider that maybe{\i0}\N{\i1}this was the wrong spot?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.59,0:02:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The bait has no right to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you fishing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.23,0:02:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"Starship Pirates." A group that\Ncalls themselves pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A group of people that like to attack a ship and rob anything and everything from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.06,0:02:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Like to rob, rob, drunken slob!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, where the hell did Spike go?!{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.61,0:02:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He left to overhaul his ship, and still hasn't—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.63,0:02:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But Spike... Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing now,\Nwithout giving us a heads-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late, Doohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Strike three! Batter out!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He just let that one slide by...{\i0}\N{\i1}and that's the game!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't they just send in a pinch-hitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Eightwood is getting old!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ya think? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.29,0:03:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Doohan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The old man's kinda busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Miles, his assistant.\NNice to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, they were really great when\Nthey won the pennant 14 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They just kept hittin' the ball one after\Nanother, and turned losing games around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.89,0:04:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when Randy, Blanket,\Nand Hills hit consecutive homers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wish you coulda seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And ya know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do people often say\Nyou're the silent type?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And people often say you\Ntalk too much, right? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The... Swordfish, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The machine back there...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the amazing mono-racer\Nthat the old man built, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just an old machine.\NI don't want it, but it's a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Us Blue Sox fans feel like we\Nfell for some wicked broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.14,0:04:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Really! I can't remember how many times\NI've thought about giving up on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:05:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus, not again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.57,0:05:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Miles, where's the checklist?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I put it on the ship's body!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been fixing that ancient thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The computer isn't compatible\Nwith the mono-system.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Miles! Gimme the EV Transmitter,\Nthe absorber for the main gear,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and the three-eight pneumatic tube!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A three-eight?! I don't have\Nsomething that special!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Order one from Reggie. His place has them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. You really are some slave driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Some hobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:05:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we catch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.88,0:06:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me! Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close! Shit, I used bad bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a good machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.99,0:06:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacking blessed people like them\Nand giving to the poor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is human equality.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't you think so?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, heh, I get it. This is what\Nya call social reform. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah. It's only right for us,{\i0}\N{\i1}the poor, to take from them!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Cops?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's enough.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounty-hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Herman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.95,0:06:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good girl and come here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.30,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Faye, above you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.30,0:06:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the—?! Is this a joke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:06:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruth! One more behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it's huge!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tattered old ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Abnormality found in the mono-system.{\i0}\N{\i1}Booting the emergency pilot program.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, stop this thing!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.27,0:07:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like I know how!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's taken\Nyou on quite a few spins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The accelerator pump is all worn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fuel injector doesn't\Nhave a silencer on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? But it's noisy, and it trembles...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you put one in, then I can't\Nhear what it's telling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and\Nconnect the injector. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, a three-eight\Nisn't popular anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you switch to the new five-zero? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you change the\Nnavigation to full-auto,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,then you can glide along\Nwithout manual steering—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to use a machine,\Nor do you want the machine to use you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't exactly—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, another assistant\Nis gonna leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And you! The Swordfish wants\Nto run away from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.43,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep being reckless with her,\Nshe'll really throw you off someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I'm not\None for delicate controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I got something you don't see often...\NA three-eight pneumatic tube!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Missing Man.\NWhere are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still with Doohan. How's Jet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He seems rather busy right now...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.49,0:10:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying something about some bacteria...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bacteria?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A virus! We got a computer virus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Same difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting with the mono-system,\Norbit calculator,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,flight path selector, engine regulator,\Ncommunications circuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they're all shot.{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Gimme a simple explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.89,0:10:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The computer broke and\Nwe're just drifting along!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.45,0:10:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I understood that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it? It's the newest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't seen one floating\Naround anywhere else, right? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A mono-computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.99,0:10:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it? 150K... No, 100K.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A bargain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's sold that cheap,\Nyou lose money even on salvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.89,0:10:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A truck? Any features?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A penguin... {\alpha&ff&}logo on... the delivery truck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.72,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A penguin... logo on... {\alpha&ff&}the delivery truck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A penguin... logo on... the delivery truck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about the info? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They apparently were\Ndealing at the Orbit Drive-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... nobody would be suspicious\Nof a delivery truck wandering about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And how are we going\Nto counter the hacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.89,0:11:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get harpooned!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And...? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They laughed this ship off as "tattered!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And they made that mess\Nout of my Hammerhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike {\i1}someone{\i0} I know,\NI always pay back what I owe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.03,0:11:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.91,0:11:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really not up for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an invoice from Doohan here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they're physically sending the virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,they haven't developed a vaccine for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That is where
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,this secret weapon of ours comes in. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That's just our normal communicator. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get infected by the virus,\Ncut off the entire mono-system.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, all navigation and\Ncomms will go down. {Original: "communication"}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said... I will navigate you with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this is set to the frequency\Nfor an old communications satellite
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.93,0:12:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,it has nothing to do with\Nthe mono-system.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:44.11,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, another run scored against the Blue Sox!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some secret weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.57,0:13:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a penguin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. A purple penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two of them? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, it might be\Na real courier service.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a matter of how to\Nfigure out if they are legit...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.66,0:13:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We fire a shot, and the one\Nthat runs is the one we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time\NI agree with you on something. {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do\Nif they're both real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.15,0:13:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They both ran?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:13:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We didn't consider that option...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trusting you with that one! {snapped to start keyframe to lower CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.48,0:14:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to pay them back for yesterday, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,W-We'll pay the parking fee!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike! Draw them out!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.86,0:14:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll be a mess if they{\i0}\N{\i1}let the virus go in there!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's see what ya got...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's after the arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not taking us seriously! Ruth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go anytime. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.73,0:15:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's holding up pretty well. {snap to start keyframe to lower CPS? Extra lead-in at least}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut off the mono-system!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot cut off his mono-system!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.01,0:15:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... George...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's in Earth's gravitational field...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:16:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man! Here, here! This is pretty bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:16:01.70,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Align the D7. Ya did it before, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:02.73,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like I remember!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No good! There's nothing we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Hurry up and\Ndo something about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.73,0:16:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit... Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.09,0:16:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Falling... We're falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike, I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.35,0:16:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm calculating an interception course.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until then, somehow keep control manually.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if everything was normal,{\i0}\N{\i1}it'd be tough to get outta here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I just had it overhauled...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Whatever happens, happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike, above you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.55,0:17:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tattered ship looks like a goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, the virus...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.41,0:17:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.59,0:17:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm still alive!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have to start over!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Old man, ya gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really gonna move\Nthis ancient piece of...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.53,0:17:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'd do this as a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get me some fuel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.39,0:17:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike, can you hear me? I got a calculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take another 7 hours\Nfor us to rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.11,0:17:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're too close to Earth. The orbital{\i0}\N{\i1}paths I can take are limited!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.09,0:18:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isn't there a way for{\i0}\N{\i1}you to just swing on by?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I plunge in at this angle,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}both the Bebop and the Swordfish\Nwill burn to nothing!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.87,0:18:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have some booze hidden behind the fridge.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Feel free to drink some.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm outta gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing I can do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How about I go there and tow you back,{\i0}\N{\i1}in exchange for that booze?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the conversation.\NGive me the Swordfish's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Doohan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell do you—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike, I don't care how ya do it,{\i0}\N{\i1}but slow down using an air-brake.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you slow down within\NEarth's atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the gravitational pull\Nwill accelerate you instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.59,0:19:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which will give you{\i0}\N{\i1}enough speed to escape.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, you have to maintain{\i0}\N{\i1}the ship at a certain angle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Too far either way, and you'll be thrown out to the other end of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I'm not\None for delicate controls. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.87,0:19:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't give you the Swordfish for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you start crashing, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximum propulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to force\Nyourself to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.05,0:20:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how Blue Sox fans love to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.83,0:20:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're flying...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're really flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lower the nose by 0.6 degrees.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.85,0:21:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're in too deep!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike, you'll burn to a crisp!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.41,0:21:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the last chance!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It went in! It went in! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That was perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Doohan, you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.53,0:21:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not quite.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.69,0:21:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the heat-resistant\Ntiles have peeled off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The temperature is rising...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.65,0:21:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh! Th-The landing gear isn't{\i0}\N{\i1}coming down either!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh yeah, and the #2 nozzle{\i0}\N{\i1}won't work either.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?! Is that for real?{\i0}\N{\i1}What are we gonna do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We can't land without them!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:22:00.77,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Oh, well... Whatever happens, happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.37,0:22:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew I shouldn't have come up here!{\i0}\N{\i1}I'm still too young to die!{\i0}
